<title>USA: Fitch rates FSA claims paying AAA.</title>
<headline>Fitch rates FSA claims paying AAA.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fitch Investors Service Inc. said Wednesday it assigned a AAA claims-paying rating to Financial Security Assurance.</p>
<p>The rating is FSA's first from Fitch, the agency said. Fitch said more details would be released in a statement later Wednesday.</p>
<p>FSA is also rated triple-A by both Moody's Investors Service Inc. and Standard &amp; Poor's Corp.</p>
<p>--Steven Dickson, 212-859-1652</p>
</text>
